{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_050jul0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_050jul0414_1000_p", "source_sha256": "3a887df1d9312acfea38a9f95be0e219b1d24b68e0dbb48c410f49abdbd7f302", "ja": "（さて。メール送信、っと。\n企画書も送り終わったし、少し休憩でもしようか……）", "zh": "好了，邮件发送完毕。企划书也发完了，稍微休息一下吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_050jul0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_050jul0414_1001_050jul", "source_sha256": "2c73943a7e405a57d8cedf8fe7b4da4f23594062d68ac109496140a66f62d3ab", "ja": "あ、お疲れ{$P$}。\nちょっと控え室、使ってもいいか？", "zh": "啊，辛苦了，{$P$}。\n我能用一下休息室吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_050jul0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_050jul0414_1002_p", "source_sha256": "bd4ec16518e2fcd70f926fe6def61dd110b9f80f872fdbe48031411e355fef39", "ja": "あれ、ジュリア？\n今日はオフのはずだったような……。", "zh": "哎，茱莉亚？\n今天应该休息才对吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_050jul0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_050jul0414_1003_050jul", "source_sha256": "6ee350e51bc63902a4114a96e94e2129186479cee1446a234892ad6adf37e7a8", "ja": "そうなんだけど……みんなと約束したんだよ。\n最近作ったフレーズを、弾いて聞かせるってさ。", "zh": "是这样没错……但我和大家约好了，要把最近写的乐句弹给大家听。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_050jul0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_050jul0414_1004_p", "source_sha256": "ca7a40d160eff88125ce112360d2ede049bf54cbfa44cdb7a141556f641f085d", "ja": "なるほど、そういう事なら自由に使ってくれ。\n時間があったら、あとで聞きに行こうかな。", "zh": "原来如此，既然是这样，就随意用吧。\n有时间的话，我之后去听听好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_050jul0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_050jul0414_1005_050jul", "source_sha256": "90ac078e66005de9b7913731441f2383793e84e6d7da3bea19f94fbba8ac6a6b", "ja": "サンキュー。途中からでも、もちろんOKだ。\n……ところで、さ。", "zh": "谢啦。中途加入也当然没问题。\n……话说回来啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_050jul0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_050jul0414_1006_050jul", "source_sha256": "348942297304293cba432a24d134ffba50c330d25ed2bb7e31ffe910a0097590", "ja": "今日のコーディネート、どうかな？\nいつもとちょっと変えてみたんだけど。", "zh": "今天的搭配怎么样？\n我特意试着换了种和平时不太一样的风格。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_050jul0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_050jul0414_1007_p", "source_sha256": "1c1d05854c405d12b593614dcc7070f8beebbeb461feb2ba279ffb171a329315", "ja": "ああ。なんだか雰囲気が違うと思ってたんだ。\nロックだけど可愛らしさもあって、よく似合ってるよ。", "zh": "嗯，我就觉得你的感觉好像有点不一样。\n虽然是摇滚风，但也很可爱，特别适合你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_050jul0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_050jul0414_1008_050jul", "source_sha256": "eac789bc71062f83cf867d9b6bc6581278113a0497e8d732f8ad8168e795b991", "ja": "だろ！？\nやっぱ{$P$}は話わかるなぁ！", "zh": "对吧！？\n果然还是{$P$}最懂我啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_050jul0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_050jul0414_1009_050jul", "source_sha256": "d5c6d6eaf740d8db7a9b4e66d245b5512f220a204eee5f4845de066985c078db", "ja": "現場のスタイリストさんで、バンド組んでたって人が\nいてさ。なんか意気投合しちゃって。", "zh": "现场有位造型师以前组过乐队，我们特别聊得来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_050jul0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_050jul0414_1010_050jul", "source_sha256": "1abd24cf1982c7fc1ab743e45dc777b2c1bef39e82d030d0e874a545f42c1864", "ja": "服の趣味も似てたから、付き合ってもらったんだ。\nあたし好みの、いい買い物ができたよ。", "zh": "衣服的品味也挺合得来的，就让她陪我去逛了。\n买到了很合我心意的东西，收获不小。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_050jul0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_050jul0414_1011_p", "source_sha256": "e6e121f61d75902d179cc107d866a1d88a0bbcb58d7ae4957982b2f5b769f853", "ja": "はは、よかったな。アイドルのかわいい姿を見てるから\nこういう姿を見ると、なんだか新鮮に感じるな。", "zh": "哈哈，那就好。平时总是在看偶像可爱的模样，看到这样的打扮，总觉得很新鲜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_050jul0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_050jul0414_1012_050jul", "source_sha256": "5f205c0887c44f9e2e8442e23e6cf36b1d398037f9c2cca0c211a56c26222f66", "ja": "ほんとだよ。フリフリだの、ヒラヒラだの……たくさん\n着せてさ。それに慣れはじめてる、あたしもいて……。", "zh": "真的啊。又是蓬蓬的，又是飘飘的……给我穿了好多这种衣服。而且，我也开始有点习惯了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_050jul0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_050jul0414_1013_050jul", "source_sha256": "05fc8ee1b74dc3f5899465fca9a576f94f9e1c57826de4659dbd31d57fbdd384", "ja": "だからまぁ、かわいいのも案外イケるかも？\nって思うようにはなってきたかな。", "zh": "所以嘛，我也渐渐觉得，可爱风格说不定还挺适合我的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_050jul0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_050jul0414_1014_p", "source_sha256": "d9a0d8eb70e4adbae67e790d596410456693822f7d6c056727b6d599b1d65831", "ja": "そうか。アイドルになって、\nジュリアの世界が広がってるってことだな。", "zh": "这样啊。成为偶像之后，茱莉亚的世界也在不断拓展，对吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_050jul0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_050jul0414_1015_050jul", "source_sha256": "c89244876b9b663bb0111f479d0c74781acf7439554839e4e905bab1cbbcc2b7", "ja": "ああ、そうだな。\nプライベートの服選びに影響が出るくらいにはな。", "zh": "啊，是啊。\n已经到了会影响我挑选私服的程度。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_050jul0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_050jul0414_1016_050jul", "source_sha256": "9449def2b2abad9b8ac47690a74d21b1014b65fd0a98dbb57850ff1180a553f2", "ja": "でも、今日はアイドルじゃない『ジュリア』だ。\nこういうロックなスタイルが一番しっくりくるよ。", "zh": "不过，今天不是偶像，而是『茱莉亚』。\n这种摇滚风格最适合我。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_050jul0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_050jul0414_1017_p", "source_sha256": "17285758b50a356ac433695b3a79344da6fd3be487077160ef2a3defcfcfcff4", "ja": "確かに。……って、そうだ。\nジュリア、時間は大丈夫なのか？", "zh": "确实。……对了，\n茱莉亚，时间来得及吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_050jul0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_050jul0414_1018_050jul", "source_sha256": "b38bda34c60321e0da4068b1a39ddf07f9f55af4316a275d19049bb781e4c54f", "ja": "ヤバイっ！　みんな待ってる……！\nそれじゃあ、また後でな、{$P$}。", "zh": "糟了！大家还在等着……\n那就待会儿见，{$P$}。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_050jul0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_050jul0414_1019_050jul", "source_sha256": "603b2a7faed436c4a1dc4fa0f0d24329039f34b19ffd29915c035e0cc5ce4d36", "ja": "ああ、それと……。\n今日の服、褒めてくれてサンキューな！", "zh": "啊，还有……谢谢你夸我今天这身衣服！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_050jul0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_050jul0414_1020_p", "source_sha256": "8eb1a67093b3a96c4019836042c4f336961c342e5603eab3f44135c90209f870", "ja": "（アイドルとロックの相乗効果で、ジュリアの世界は\nもっと広がるはずだ。さて、俺も控え室に行こうかな）", "zh": "（偶像与摇滚的协同效应，一定能让茱莉亚的世界更加广阔。好了，我也去休息室吧。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
